the components themselves — "whether alone, in a bundle, or as a ported
version". This file is such a port, and it is published in this repository, so
the port is redistributed in source form. The GPL-3.0 grant above does not
extend to it: no additional rights in that file are granted here, and a
downstream user cannot treat it as GPL-3.0 code.

Tracked as a known risk rather than a settled question. The intent is to
